        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading the edges&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;hollow triangle + dashed = realises a Protocol&lt;br&gt;hollow triangle = extends (schema inheritance)&lt;br&gt;dashed open arrow = depends on / returns / serialises&lt;br&gt;open arrow = association (the only FK)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Protocols exist so tests can pass a stub: typing&lt;br&gt;against the concrete class made every fake a type error.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;rounded=0;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
